폴리싱 과정에서 워치의 각 부분 마다 소재가 가진 고유의 빛이 온전히 드러나도록 작업합니다. 이러한 마감 단계는 전 과정이 수작업으로 이루어지며, 극도의 정밀함을 요구합니다."]},{type:"videoBlock",media:{url:"/videos/productPages/baignoire-and-Myst/videoBlock.mp4",type:"video",ariaLabel:""}},{type:"productsBlock",medias:[{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/productsBlock1.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/productsBlock2.webp",ariaLabel:""}]},{type:"scrollMediasBlock",text:"미스트 드 까르띠에는 메종이 가진 창의성의 계보를 뚜렷히 이어가는 독보적인 미학을 지닌 워치입니다. 놀라운 구조 속에 숨긴 미스터리가 특별한 형태를 보여줍니다. 잠금장치가 없어 트롱프뢰유(trompe-l'œil) 브레이슬릿 같기도 하고, 비즈처럼 꿰어 둔 요소들 때문에 운명을 보호하는 부적처럼 보이기도 합니다.",medias:[{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock1-2.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock2-2.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"조각 작품 같은 워치"},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock3-2.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"주얼리와 워치메이킹을 잇는 연결고리"},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock4-2.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"블랙 래커로 더욱 강렬해진 대담한 시각적 요소들"},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock5-2.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"트롱프뢰유 브레이슬릿"}]},{type:"textBlock",text:"주얼러들은 브레이슬릿을 위해 비즈 세팅을 선택했고, 다양한 크기의 스톤을 활용해 원근감과 볼륨감을 구현했습니다. 이 구조적인 긴장감을 완성하는 세팅 작업에만 최대 47시간이 필요했습니다."},{type:"sliderBlock",layoutVariant:"landscape",medias:[{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock1.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock2.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock3.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock4.webp",ariaLabel:""}]},{type:"productsBlock",text:"메종이 보유한 워치메이킹과 주얼리 제작의 두 가지 전문성을 모두 활용하여 완성하는 까르띠에의 주얼리 워치. 쉽게 접할 수 없는 모티프와 스톤 세팅의 방식은 물론, 인체공학적인 디자인과 감각적인 착용감을 선사합니다.",medias:[{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/productsBlock1-2.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/productsBlock2-2.webp",ariaLabel:""}]},{type:"sliderProductsBlock",title:"컬렉션 더 알아보기",cards:[{title:"팬더 드 까르띠에 워치",url:"https://www.cartier.com/ko-kr/CRWJPN0059.html",media:{ariaLabel:"",url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderProductsBlock1.webp"}},{title:"베누아 워치",url:"https://www.cartier.com/ko-kr/CRWJBA0046.html",media:{ariaLabel:"",url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderProductsBlock2.webp"}},{title:"베누아 워치",url:"https://www.cartier.com/ko-kr/CRWJBA0053.html",media:{ariaLabel:"",url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderProductsBlock3.webp"}},{title:"탱크 아메리칸 워치",url:"https://www.cartier.com/ko-kr/CRWJTA0056.html",media:{ariaLabel:"",url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderProductsBlock4.webp"}}],cta:{url:"",label:""}},{type:"textBlock",text:"인스타그램에서 까르띠에 워치 커뮤니티와 함께하세요",textSize:"m",subtitle:"@cartierwatchcommunity"},{type:"sliderBlock",medias:[{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock1-2.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock2-2.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock3-2.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock4-2.webp",ariaLabel:""}]},{type:"textBlock",text:"베누아와 미스트에 대한 자세한 정보",textSize:"m",button:[{url:"https://www.cartier.com/ko-kr/creative-capsules.html",label:""},{url:"+8218774326",label:"상담원에게 문의하세요",type:"ambassador"}],textBlockType:"contact",media:{url:"/images/productPages/roadster/newsletterBlock.webp",ariaLabel:""}},{type:"newsletterBlock",media:{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/newsletterBlock.webp",ariaLabel:""},card:{title:"기대해 주세요",text:"메종이 직접 공개하는 최신 워치메이킹 뉴스를 받아보세요",button:{url:"/",label:"구독하기"}}},{type:"pushPageBlock",title:"계속해서 더 알아보기",button:{url:"/",label:"뒤로 가기"}}]}}),Zet=()=>({market:"Belgium",title:"Baignoire en Myst de Cartier",uri:"the-eye-of-the-jeweller",slug:"the-eye-of-the-jeweller",type:"product",loaded:1,watchSceneIndex:2,content:{blocks:[{type:"heroBlock",title:"Baignoire en Myst de Cartier",subtitle:"Het oog van een juwelier"},{type:"scrollMediasBlock",text:"Haar inventiviteit en levendigheid bij het vervaardigen van horloges ontleent Cartier ook aan de juweliersexpertise van het Maison; vormen worden gesublimeerd door middel van een motief of een edelsteenzetting.",medias:[{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock1.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"Bezet met Clous de Paris"},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock2.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"Het motief voegt ritme en structuur toe"},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock3.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"Een zintuiglijke draagervaring"},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock4.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"Volledig met de hand gepolijst"},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock5.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"Het iconische ovale horloge"}]},{type:"scrollWatchBlock",texts:["De horlogemakers van Cartier hebben een op juwelen geïnspireerde stijl gecreëerd, die nog wordt versterkt door het kenmerkende Clou de Paris-motief. Dit innovatieve avontuur verlegt creatieve grenzen met een ongekende uiting van vakmanschap.","De meester-juweliers van Cartier laten elk horloge stralen tijdens de polijstfase. Deze afwerkingsfase wordt volledig met de hand uitgevoerd en vereist de grootste precisie."]},{type:"videoBlock",media:{url:"/videos/productPages/baignoire-and-Myst/videoBlock.mp4",type:"video",ariaLabel:""}},{type:"productsBlock",medias:[{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/productsBlock1.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/productsBlock2.webp",ariaLabel:""}]},{type:"scrollMediasBlock",text:"Myst de Cartier is een horloge met een unieke esthetiek, die resoluut in het teken staat van creativiteit. Het mysterie krijgt vorm door middel van een verrassende constructie. Er is geen sluiting, waardoor de band een trompe-l'œil-effect krijgt. De elementen waaruit hij bestaat zijn als kralen aan elkaar geregen en lijken op beschermende talismannen.",medias:[{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock1-2.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock2-2.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"Een horloge als een beeldhouwwerk"},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock3-2.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"De connectie tussen juwelierswerk en horlogemaken"},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock4-2.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"Krachtige visuele elementen, benadrukt met zwart lakwerk"},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock5-2.webp",ariaLabel:"",subtitle:"Een band met trompe l’oeil-effect"}]},{type:"textBlock",text:"De juweliers hebben de band verfraaid met een kralenzetting, waarbij stenen van verschillende afmetingen worden gebruikt om diepgang en volume te creëren. Er is 47 uur aan zetwerk nodig om deze architectonische spanning te creëren."},{type:"sliderBlock",layoutVariant:"landscape",medias:[{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock1.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock2.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock3.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/sliderBlock4.webp",ariaLabel:""}]},{type:"productsBlock",text:"In een Maison dat twee vakgebieden combineert, blinken de juweelhorloges uit door de kostbare motieven, de edelsteenzetting, de ergonomische vormgeving en de zintuiglijke draagervaring.",medias:[{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/productsBlock1-2.webp",ariaLabel:""},{url:"/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/productsBlock2-2.webp",ariaLabel:""}]},{type:"sliderProductsBlock",title:"Ontdek de collectie",cards:[{title:"PANTHÈRE DE CARTIER-HORLOGE",url:"https://www.cartier.com/nl-be/product/CRWJPN0059",media:{ariaLabel:"",url:"/images/productPage